import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 298 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Eternal Peace Surnamed Ye: The Essence of Oligarchic Civilization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 298 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Eternal Peace Surnamed Ye: The Essence of Oligarchic Civilization","no":298,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Eternal Peace Surnamed Ye","Oligarchic Civilization","Ye Fan","Civilization Essence"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","26-Individual-Collective Balance Principle","30-Five Symbiotic Civilization Typology Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0298_模块2-遮天-万世太平姓叶.md","filePath":"en/0298_模块2-遮天-万世太平姓叶.md"}'),o={name:"en/0298_模块2-遮天-万世太平姓叶.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,u,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-298-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-eternal-peace-surnamed-ye-the-essence-of-oligarchic-civilization" tabindex="-1">Entry 298 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Eternal Peace Surnamed Ye: The Essence of Oligarchic Civilization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-298-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-eternal-peace-surnamed-ye-the-essence-of-oligarchic-civilization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 298 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Eternal Peace Surnamed Ye: The Essence of Oligarchic Civilization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 11) | Benchmark base: Documents 03, 26, 30</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-peace-is-good-but-on-what-grounds-does-peace-bear-the-surname-ye" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Peace is good, but on what grounds does peace bear the surname Ye <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-peace-is-good-but-on-what-grounds-does-peace-bear-the-surname-ye" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Peace is good, but on what grounds does peace bear the surname Ye&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires governance power to belong to Myriad-Ranks consensus, not any family; the collective ascension axiom requires strong ones to feed back, not hereditarily. This entry directly dissects the core proposition of Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; ending — &quot;eternal peace surnamed Ye.&quot; This phrase is not praise, but Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s most precise pathological slice of oligarchic civilization. The law-first axiom reminds: even peace&#39;s surname is designated, showing order has never truly been institutionalized. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Peace surnamed Ye&quot; energy waste:</p><ul><li>Ye Fan and his peer strong-one group use cosmos-tier force to &quot;watch over&quot; the world; time that could have been used for institutional construction is consumed &quot;keeping watch&quot;</li><li>Later elites mistakenly think peace comes from the Ye family&#39;s blessing, losing the will and ability to build their own order</li><li>Cultivators outside the Ye family&#39;s trusted line lack channels to rise to the &quot;co-governance layer&quot;; civilization governance energy idles</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Oligarchic peace&#39;s regression logic:</p><ol><li><strong>Peace dependent</strong>: peace is not an institutional product, but the Ye family and their circle&#39;s &quot;bestowed peace&quot;; circle present = peace present</li><li><strong>Succession no procedure</strong>: who comes to &quot;watch&quot; after the Ye family? Settings do not answer — this is leaving civilization to suspense</li><li><strong>Myriad-Ranks subjectivity lost</strong>: because there is always someone covering, Myriad Ranks never learn to manage themselves; once coverage fails, they do not even know how to end chaos</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind &quot;eternal peace surnamed Ye&quot; is ownership-level predation:</p><ul><li><strong>Treating civilization as private property</strong>: peace is &quot;given&quot; by the Ye family, equivalent to defaulting that the world is the Ye family&#39;s industry</li><li><strong>Co-governance rights confiscated</strong>: Myriad Ranks are excluded from governance, only enjoying the &quot;protected&quot; position</li><li><strong>Inter-generational monopoly</strong>: Ye Fan&#39;s line and his trusted allies form a de facto oligarchic group; civilization&#39;s top is de facto hereditary</li></ul><p>Ye Fan may never thought &quot;heredity,&quot; but once the structure forms, it will grow hereditary teeth itself.</p><p>Eternal peace surnamed Ye also has a hidden layer: it semantically binds &quot;peace&quot; and &quot;Ye family.&quot; Under this binding, any questioning of the Ye family is automatically read as a threat to peace — so Myriad Ranks even automatically give up the right to criticize the Ye family. This is oligarchy&#39;s most sophisticated self-protection: it needs no force to suppress dissent, because dissent has already automatically disappeared in Myriad Ranks&#39; hearts. Heng Yuan Zhou writing peace into the charter and dispersing governance power to the council precisely severs this semantic binding — peace does not belong to any surname; criticizing any family is not opposing peace.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Ye-Surnamed Eternal Peace</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Republican Peace</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Peace watched by the Ye family</td><td>Peace auto-runs by charter</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad Ranks are protected ones</td><td>Myriad Ranks are governance subjects</td></tr><tr><td>Succession by Ye-family transmission</td><td>Anchor Council election + assessment</td></tr><tr><td>Governance rights de facto hereditary</td><td>Anti-monopoly constitutionalized, governance rights may not be privately transmitted</td></tr><tr><td>Peace dependent on family</td><td>Peace universal-benefits all beings</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Ye Fan&#39;s post-rise &quot;oligarchic group — Myriad Ranks&quot; power structure</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject three groups of &quot;Ye family in office for generations,&quot; &quot;Ye family third generation exits,&quot; &quot;co-governance institution established&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: peace duration, Myriad Ranks governance participation rate</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — Ye-surnamed peace has extremely high collapse probability after second / third generation exits; only writing peace into institutions can make &quot;eternal&quot; truly possible</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. &quot;Eternal peace&quot; mechanism is vague; how Ye Fan &quot;watches for eternity&quot; lacks rule support</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Eternal peace is more like a slogan, not a calculable institution</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong>. Peace directly hinges on Ye Fan and his family — this is precisely the definition of &quot;medium dependency / oligarchic&quot;</li></ul><p>Eternal peace surnamed Ye also has a generational problem: Ye Fan&#39;s descendants may not have Ye Fan&#39;s ability. The first-generation Ye family may still hold; the second, third generation? Shrouding-the-Heavens is vague. Heng Yuan Zhou taking governance power from families precisely because it knows &quot;a wise ruler&#39;s descendants remain wise&quot; is an assumption never historically confirmed. Betting civilization on family genes is more dangerous than betting on one person — a person eventually dies, but a family may continue mediocre for a thousand years.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cosmos-tier force used to &quot;keep watch,&quot; governance energy idled</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: declaring civilization peace as family private property</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit at least had an academy as public-institution prototype; Ye Fan&#39;s peace has no public institution at all</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: in &quot;Ye-surnamed peace,&quot; Myriad Ranks are beneficiaries, not participants</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: family-style peace cannot export a stable paradigm to other multiverse civilizations</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Eternal peace&quot; four characters, Shrouding-the-Heavens only delivered the first two — &quot;eternal&quot; is vision, &quot;peace&quot; is what Ye Fan fought out. The peace Heng Yuan Zhou wants is not bestowed by anyone, but one no one can take away.</p><p>Changing peace&#39;s surname from &quot;Ye&quot; to &quot;Myriad Ranks&quot; requires only one constitutional clause; but making Myriad Ranks truly believe this clause requires generations of institutional practice. What Shrouding-the-Heavens lacks is not the clause, but practice.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · eternal peace surnamed Ye described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./288_模块2-遮天-总论叶凡孤道与寡头式文明.html">Entry 288 · Overview</a> · <a href="./297_模块2-遮天-大帝制度批判.html">Entry 297 · Emperor Institution Critique</a> · <a href="./321_模块2-遮天-文明权重分析.html">321 · Civilization Weight Analysis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
